      "title": "check_typed_item_calls: Add ENC_BOM and ENC_VARINT_*",
      "message": "check_typed_item_calls: Add ENC_BOM and ENC_VARINT_*\n\nStrings, if ENC_UTF_16, ENC_UCS_2, or ENC_UCS_4, can have ENC_BOM.\n(ENC_LITTLE_ENDIAN is listed twice, so use one of those spots.)\n\nInteger types, especially FT_UINT64 and FT_INT64, can be the\nENC_VARINT types (ZIGZAG is signed, the others are unsigned.)\n\nThese false warnings caused some incorrect commits.\n",
